{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>And you shall keep My charge.</b> This is the charge, namely not to do." "The meaning of <b>that were done before them.</b> Lest a person say: since the ancients did so, I too will do so." "The meaning of <b>I am HaShem your Elohim.</b> It is joined to \"My charge,\" lest a deficient person ask: why this charge? For I am HaShem your Elohim; do all that I command you."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:10:49.690326970Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}